OL,5,G0306 Outlook
OL,6,     FSibylle Baier was horrified when
OL,7,     Fher son handed out copies of a
OL,8,     Frecord she'd made in her 20s to
OL,9,     Fguests at her 60th birthday party.
OL,10,     FWhat followed was a reaction
OL,11,     Fneither imagined.
OL,12,G0350 Witness History
OL,13,     FIn 2013, people in Rjukan, Norway
OL,14,     Fexperienced winter sunshine for
OL,15,     Fthe first time - thanks to three
OL,16,     Fgiant mirrors that were placed on
OL,17,     Ftop of a nearby mountain.
